OK, since there seems to be a current discusion on how to get poison
resistance through the eating of non-poisonous monster corpses, I've
decided to repost the following list I compiled through many long
sessions of Nethack. In case anyone is unaware, Babs is a vegetarian.
Thus my reasons for creating this list were to figure out what intrinsics
I could gain by only eating the vegetarian-type monsters.
Hope someone finds this usueful.
----

