( there may be other edible monsters I've forgotten or haven't came
  across, but these are the guys I've found and what has been gained
  intrinsicly by eating them )

To date, I've found no way to get desintigration resistance, magic resistance,
teleport, teleport control or telepathy through the eating of vegetarian-type
monsters, so have quite simply done without (without to many dificulties).

